:\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"Juist daarom vind ik het zo tof om les te geven. Ik help mensen graag om hun sportprestaties te verbeteren, maar nog belangrijker: om met plezier te komen sporten en met een glimlach de les weer te verlaten.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"Want als je met plezier beweegt, komt de progressie vanzelf!\",\"type\":\"text\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"root\",\"version\":1}},\"updatedAt\":\"2026-03-22T20:11:53.142Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-01-08T11:03:06.594Z\",\"email\":\"iska@sportlabgroningen.nl\",\"sessions\":[],\"collection\":\"users\"},{\"id\":3,\"name\":\"Amy McKeogh\",\"generateSlug\":false,\"slug\":\"amy-mckeogh\",\"status\":\"active\",\"roles\":[\"user\",\"coach\"],\"isCoach\":true,\"avatar\":null,\"subtitle\":\"Personal trainer & assistant manager personal training\",\"about\":\"\",\"position\":3,\"content\":{\"root\":{\"children\":[{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"Amy McKeogh\",\"type\":\"text\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"heading\",\"version\":1,\"tag\":\"h2\"},{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":3,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"Personal trainer & Assistent manager personal training\",\"type\":\"text\",\"version\":1,\"$\":{\"color\":\"white\",\"fontFamily\":\"montserrat\"}}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":3,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"Originally from Ireland, I'm currently studying Sports Studies in Groningen, combining my academic knowledge with my passion for fitness and performance.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"I have been involved in both individual and team sports for most of my life, but at 15, I discovered Pilates and hybrid training, which sparked my interest in helping people move and feel better. Since then, I’ve focused on helping people stay injury-free, whether they’re recovering from something or simply looking to build a stronger, more resilient body.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"At Sportlab, you will mainly find me doing personal training, as well as leading Pre/Post Natal personal training, Core & Mobility, and Strength classes. My training style focuses on pushing people beyond what they think they're capable of while ensuring a fun, safe and welcoming atmosphere. Taking your fitness to the next level by focusing on the details, I’m here to help you become the strongest and fittest version of yourself.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"Maak een afspraak\",\"type\":\"text\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"link\",\"version\":3,\"fields\":{\"doc\":{\"relationTo\":\"pages\",\"value\":\"$27:props:children:props:children:1:props:children:props:users:0:content:root:children:12:children:0:fields:doc:value\"},\"size\":\"md\",\"variant\":\"orangeBorder\",\"linkType\":\"internal\",\"buttonSpacing\":\"md\",\"alignment\":\"left\"},\"id\":\"69c2b8d7ad0d815b6e1d02fe\"}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"root\",\"version\":1}},\"updatedAt\":\"2026-03-27T13:50:56.827Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-01-08T10:48:19.418Z\",\"email\":\"amy@sportlabgroningen.nl\",\"sessions\":[],\"collection\":\"users\"},{\"id\":7,\"name\":\"Lieuwe van der Bijl\",\"generateSlug\":false,\"slug\":\"lieuwe-van-der-bijl\",\"status\":\"active\",\"roles\":[\"user\",\"coach\"],\"isCoach\":true,\"avatar\":null,\"subtitle\":\"Personal trainer & groepslesinstructeur\",\"about\":\"\",\"position\":4,\"content\":{\"root\":{\"children\":[{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"Lieuwe van der Bijl\",\"type\":\"text\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"heading\",\"version\":1,\"tag\":\"h2\"},{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":3,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"Personal trainer & groepslesinstructeur\",\"type\":\"text\",\"version\":1,\"$\":{\"fontFamily\":\"montserrat\",\"color\":\"white\"}}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":3,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"Hoi! Mijn naam is Lieuwe, ik ben 25 jaar oud en sinds een paar maanden actief als trainer bij Sportlab. Via Stijn ben ik bij Sportlab terechtgekomen en ik heb het enorm naar mijn zin.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"Wat ik zo leuk vind aan Sportlab is de community. Er heerst een erg leuke sfeer en iedereen gaat fijn met elkaar om. Zelf vind ik het ook leuk om actief bezig te zijn. Zo ben ik nog aan het voetballen, vind ik hardlopen leuk en pik ik waar mogelijk een lesje mee bij Sportlab.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"Mijn doel als trainer is om mensen in beweging te krijgen. Dat probeer ik te doen door leuke en uitdagende lessen te maken voor iedereen. Ik vind het belangrijk dat sporters bij Sportlab zich kunnen verbeteren en uitdagen op hun eigen niveau.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"i